# Review/design subagents write scratch tests into test/ and `git add -A` has
# no opinion about intent — three such files reached commits on 2026-08-01,
# and test/zzRefuteScratch.test.ts has been on main since 07-28. A test count
# is the evidence a change is safe; it must not include files nobody read.
test/zz*
test/_scratch*
test/*.probe.test.ts
